WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.729
Let's sort out the two strands.

00:00:02.356 --> 00:00:04.109
On the bottom is the template strand.

00:00:04.736 --> 00:00:06.594
RNA polymerase reads this one.

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.869
Watch the RNA build up to match

00:00:08.916 --> 00:00:09.171
it.

00:00:10.018 --> 00:00:11.667
On top is the coding strand.

00:00:12.294 --> 00:00:13.768
It is not read, and it is

00:00:13.838 --> 00:00:14.779
not transcribed.

00:00:15.626 --> 00:00:17.391
Think of tracing paper laid over just

00:00:17.449 --> 00:00:18.181
one side.

00:00:18.901 --> 00:00:20.213
Template strand: read.

00:00:20.839 --> 00:00:22.384
Coding strand: not read.

00:00:23.011 --> 00:00:24.438
Now try the question again.
